{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1303739-shazam-as-an-exalted-story-spoilers-within","id":1303739,"title":"Shazam as an Exalted story [spoilers within]","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-04-09T02:25:36-07:00","id":1303739,"title":"Shazam as an Exalted story [spoilers within]","content":"Both Billy Batson and Thaddeus Sivana are directly empowered by otherworldly beings. Billy's experience doesn't map well to a Dynast, who are raised knowing there's at least a possibility they'll gain supernatural power; but what about a newly-Exalted Solar? A brand-new Chosen of the Unconquered Sun presumably knows that <i>something</i> dramatically out of the ordinary has happened to them; but do they know immediately how to use their new powers, or is there a sequence like that with Billy and Freddy, where the new Solar is trying everything he can think of to figure out what he can do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1856-hakkonen","name":"Hakkonen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"159"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-09T06:11:14-07:00","id":1303763,"title":"","content":"I'd argue that even a Solar story won't necessarily play out like Billy Batson's, as a Solar's Charms are merely supernatural extensions of what they're already good at, and aside from the ones they have when they first take the Second Breath, they're still generally getting them as the result of training.<br /> <br /> \u200bLike, I'd expect a freshly-Exalted Solar with high Athletics to maybe spend the scene of his Exaltation inadvertently overshooting his jumps by twenty feet or accidentally destroying scenery, but not the Lore-Supernal Twilight.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 04-09-2019, 09:17 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-09T13:42:14-07:00","id":1303820,"title":"","content":"Billy Batson powers are flagrantly supernatural, external gifts that have been given to Billy. They're weird, difficult to control, and seem like they have a life of their own. They can be passed from person like an artifact. Moreover, Billy gets the powers not because he deserves them, but because the old wizard is desperate, and Billy's the best available. I think Billy's a much better example of an exigent.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24366-slarn","name":"Slarn!","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24366_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"67"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-09T22:24:26-07:00","id":1303892,"title":"","content":"Additionally, the original source of his power was derived from a eclectic cohort of gods and biblical characters.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/487-greyman","name":"Greyman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar487_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1308"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-11T11:54:42-07:00","id":1304278,"title":"","content":"How for another inspiring character of the film, how about Dr Sivana? Worked his life as a scorned child after having seen something properly awesome to finally gain his own sorcerous initiation, linking him to a couple of demons?<br /> <br /> Or the moment he stands revolted in front of his lord and father, to prove to them that his life's purpose have made him the only powerful one of the two?<br /> <br /> And the honest to god cool effect of his mist-demons extending as they are ripped from his body into the material world?<br /> <br /> Honestly, I could get a few good things out of it. (Cool character concept, weird mist-specie of first circle, another demon-themed sorcerous initiation... Or even a new vision of seeing Infernal Exaltations, as traps left in the world by the Yozi, demons bound during the war and made dormant until now, where they can start to offer powers undreamt off to ambitious and dysfunctional mortals.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Ultimate Jade-Screened Exalted Scholar, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1304239-my-next-campaign-tdhr-peach\" target=\"_blank\">THDR : Future Dragon-Blooded campaign</a>, and other links.<br /> If you like Ex3, you can support <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/holdenshearer\" target=\"_blank\">Holden</a> on Patreon!","edited":{"userid":541,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/541-letipex","user":"LeTipex","date":". 04-11-2019, 03:00 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/541-letipex","name":"LeTipex","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar541_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 